From: Ravindra Lakkireddy <85186928+rlakki08@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 20:00:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06/12] fix(voice): speech-to-text retries once, then falls
 back to xAI grok-transcribe

The voice test's p11 got httpx.ConnectError from Groq Whisper. transcribe() retries a dropped
connection or a 5xx once; when Groq still can't (every key limited, down), the audio goes to
xAI's grok-transcribe over one short realtime session (xAI has no REST transcription endpoint:
/v1/audio/transcriptions is a 404, checked 2026-09-26): PCM16 24 kHz, commit, the newest
transcript, closed before the voice model's reply (~3 s live). /voice/command answers 503, never
500, when both fail (KeysExhausted and httpx errors included).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
